            <h2>A bit about me.</h2>
        </div>

        <div class="about-grid">
            <div class="panel glass glass--lit bio reveal">
                <p>
                    I'm a full-stack engineer based in
                    <strong>Bristol, UK</strong>, working at
                    <strong>Artis Works</strong> on a financial app. Most of my
                    day is spent on candlestick charts and the custom plugins
                    around them, though real-time market data is a big part of
                    it too: live prices coming in over WebSockets, an AG Grid
                    that has to stay performant while it updates, and the
                    dependency graphs sitting behind those numbers in the
                    worker.
                </p>
                <p>
                    I've been writing code almost daily since 2017. Outside of
                    work it's mostly open source projects, and a lot of it ends
                    up being about <strong>privacy and security</strong>: an
                    encrypted file-sharing app, an anonymous chat client, a
                    password manager, and a self-hosted stock portfolio tracker.
                    Symmetric and asymmetric encryption is something I enjoy
                    working with, particularly when it lets an app work without
                    asking the user to trust a server.
                </p>
                <p>
                    I like clean, readable code, and I like being involved in
                    the whole thing: requirements, design, migrations, tests and
                    release, not only the part that renders.
                </p>
                <div class="bio-marks">
